    "body": "Looks already fixed on upstream/main 470d1a27c: `egui_app::setup_wcs_tests` passes without a change (6 of 6, macOS). Suggest closing; the maintainer decides.\n\nEvidence:\n\n- The two failing heads, `c6f3e9ae4` and `df13bbaf6`, are after #4299 and before #4329.\n- #4299 raised the Tormach work offsets to G54.1 P10-P500. The test at those heads still expected 9 combo entries.\n- I ran the test file of `df13bbaf6` on macOS. It fails the same way: `left: 255, right: 9` at `setup_wcs_tests.rs:158`. Thus the failure was not Windows-only.\n- Commit 3761f682e (PR #4329, `Fixes #4322`) changed the test to expect 255 entries. That is the fix.\n- Windows check: the next quick gate of main at or after `470d1a27c` on bacon or winnie must show this test green.\n\nNo claim was made and no branch was pushed.\n",
